## Minimal “safe counter” pattern

```js
class AsyncCounter {
  #value = 0;
  #q = Promise.resolve();
  increment() {
    this.#q = this.#q.then(() => { this.#value++; });
    return this.#q;
  }
  get value() { return this.#value; }
}

const c = new AsyncCounter();
await Promise.all([c.increment(), c.increment(), c.increment()]);
console.log(c.value); // always 3
```

This serializes updates without explicit locks by chaining promises.

