// Watch expressions examples:
user.permissions.includes("write")
cart.total() - cart.discount
typeof window.myGlobal
```

Also inspect **Scope** (Local, Closure, Global) and **Call Stack** to navigate frames.

**Use cases:** verifying invariants without editing code; exploring closure variables.

