## Quick checklist

- Validate at startup with a schema (Zod/Joi/envalid).
- Coerce types explicitly; never trust `process.env` typing.
- `.env` in `.gitignore`; commit `.env.example`.
- Load dotenv before any module reads env (or use `--env-file`).
- Prefix client-exposed vars deliberately; keep secrets server-only.
- No defaults for required secrets/URLs.
- Don't mutate `process.env`; pass typed config objects.
- Redact secrets from logs.
- Remember bundlers inline env at build time.

