## Typical use cases

| Environment | Use case | Recommended approach |
|---|---|---|
| Node.js | Config/data loading | `fs/promises` + `readFile` |
| Node.js | Logging, reports | `createWriteStream` or `appendFile` |
| Node.js | Large files/media | Streams + `pipeline` |
| Node.js | Atomic writes | Write temp file, then `rename` |
| Browser | User uploads | `<input type="file">` + `FileReader` |
