Save it as `validation.html` and open it in any browser.

```html
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<title>Input Validation – Complete Example</title>
<style>
  body { font-family: system-ui, sans-serif; margin: 2rem; max-width: 640px; }
  label { display:block; margin-top:1rem; font-weight:600; }
  input { width:100%; padding:.5rem; margin-top:.25rem; }
