## Typical Use Cases

| Scenario | What to validate | Example rule |
|---|---|---|
| **Registration form** | email uniqueness, password strength | `min(8)`, regex for complexity |
| **Payment / checkout** | card number (Luhn), amount > 0, currency enum | `z.number().positive()` |
| **Search / filters** | page/limit integers, sort enum | clamp `limit` to 1–100 |
| **File upload** | MIME type, size, extension | whitelist `["image/png","image/jpeg"]` |
| **API body (JSON)** | required keys, nested shapes | schema with `.strict()` to reject unknown keys |
| **Query params** | coerce strings → numbers/dates | `z.coerce.number()` |
| **Webhooks** | signature, timestamp freshness | HMAC + `abs(now - ts) < 300000` |

