## 7. Rounding & Formatting

### 7.1 `toFixed` returns string and rounds with banker's? No—rounds half away? Actually binary issues
```js
console.log((2.5).toFixed(0));  // "3"  (not 2)
console.log((3.5).toFixed(0));  // "4"
console.log((0.123456789).toFixed(2)); // "0.12"
// Edge: large numbers
console.log((1e21).toFixed(2)); // "1.00e+21" (exponential for large)
```

### 7.2 `toPrecision`
```js
