## 13. Linear Algebra / Dot Products

### 13.1 Kahan summation for accuracy
```js
function kahanSum(arr) {
  let sum = 0, c = 0;
  for (const x of arr) {
    const y = x - c;
    const t = sum + y;
    c = (t - sum) - y;
    sum = t;
  }
  return sum;
}
```

### 13.2 Dot product numerical stability
```js
function dot(a,b) {
  let s=0;
  for (let i=0;i<a.length;i++) s += a[i]*b[i];
  return s;
}
// for huge vectors use pairwise or Kahan
```

