## Summary Checklist

| Edge case | Guard |
|---|---|
| Empty array | return NaN / 0 explicitly |
| Single element variance | n-1 → 0 → Infinity/NaN; guard n<2 |
| NaN in data | filter or propagate deliberately |
| Infinity | Number.isFinite |
| -0 | Object.is or normalize with `x + 0` |
| Large n | avoid spread; use reduce |
| Bitwise | mask with `>>> 0` if unsigned intended |
| BigInt | never mix with Number |
| Sorting | numeric comparator; handle NaN |
| Precision | Kahan summation; epsilon comparisons |
| Constant series (correlation) | check zero variance |
| Factorial/gamma | log-space for large n |
| Typed arrays | watch overflow/wrap |
| Sparse arrays | filter holes or use length carefully |
| Security random | crypto.getRandomValues |

