## 11. Snapshot testing pitfalls

```js
// ❌ Over-broad snapshot hides regressions
expect(render()).toMatchSnapshot();

// ✅ Narrow, semantic assertions
expect(screen.getByRole('heading')).toHaveTextContent('Welcome');
```

**Edge cases**
- CI auto-updating snapshots (`-u`) can mask changes; require review.
- Large snapshots are unreadable; prefer inline snapshots for small outputs.
- Non-deterministic fields (timestamps, IDs) must be normalized before snapshot.

