## Bit flags and masks

```ts
enum Permission {
  Read = 1 << 0,
  Write = 1 << 1,
  Execute = 1 << 2,
}

let flags = Permission.Read | Permission.Write;

const canWrite = (flags & Permission.Write) !== 0;
flags |= Permission.Execute;   // add
flags &= ~Permission.Write;     // remove
```

For dense bit-packing, prefer `Uint8Array` or `DataView` plus explicit bit shifts.

