## 13. Comparing bytes (reference equality)

```ts
function bytesEqual(a: Uint8Array, b: Uint8Array): boolean {
  if (a.byteLength !== b.byteLength) return false;
  // timing-safe-ish? Use crypto.subtle or constant-time compare for secrets
  for (let i = 0; i < a.byteLength; i++) if (a[i] !== b[i]) return false;
  return true;
}

const a = new Uint8Array([1,2]);
const b = new Uint8Array([1,2]);
console.log(a === b);        // false
console.log(bytesEqual(a,b)); // true
```

**Edge case:** for secrets (HMAC, tokens), use constant-time comparison to avoid timing attacks; naive loop short-circuits.

