npx ts-node src/index.ts
# Error: Expected exactly one name, got 0.
```

### 5. Build and use as a real CLI

```bash
npm run build
node dist/index.js Dave --upper
# HELLO, DAVE!
```

If you add `"bin": { "greet": "dist/index.js" }` to `package.json` and run `npm link`, you can call `greet Alice` from anywhere.

