| Use case | Approach |
|---|---|
| Simple CRUD app | ORM (Prisma/TypeORM) for speed and migrations |
| Complex analytics SQL | Raw driver (`pg`) with typed helpers |
| High-throughput microservice | Connection pool + prepared statements |
